{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\alang1037 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\cf1\insrsid3041949 ta, risaltavano, pi\'f9}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0\alang1037 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\cf1\insrsid3041949\charrsid5206459 
